<p>Yu sakina ne pukaara ae mere baba Hussain<br />
Ab nahi koi hamaara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Shimr baali khenchta hai, kaan se aajaiye<br />
Aayiye ab to khudaara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Raat hoti hai barasti , Oos sar par dekhiye<br />
hai phata kurta hamara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Naatawaa'n hai bediyaa'n hai, deejiye aakar zara<br />
Bhai aabid ko sahaara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Baandh kar rassi gale me, khainchta hai shirmr jab<br />
Maine ammu ko pukaara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Jal gaye qaime lute hum, chaadarei'n cheeni gayi<br />
ab nahi jeena gawaara ae mere baba Hussain</p>

<p>Hil gaya arshe mo'alla laash tharrayi taqi<br />
jab sab sakina ne pukara ae mere baba Hussain</p>